window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I spent my life pretending to be just a normal witch, on the run from the Black Guard. But I'm a seer. My ability is to see the future.</p> <p>So why don't I see a way out of this mess?</p> <p>Bane, the bounty hunter, Ambrose, the alpha shifter, and Christian, the king vampire, and I are trapped together in a dying prison. The warden is determined not just to make sure we never escape, but that we never see the light of day again—and he's ready to burn down the prison and kill everyone to make sure we never tell anyone about his corrupt dealings.</p> <p>But with these powerful males by my side, we might just be able to save not just ourselves, but all the supes, in and out of Nightstone.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
